stateDiagram-v2
 state "等待依赖" as Blocked
 state "任务就绪" as Ready
 state "执行中" as Running
 state "独立验证" as Verifying
 state "独立审查" as Reviewing
 state "需要返工" as Rework
 state "任务完成" as Done
 state "任务撤销" as Cancelled
 [*] --> Blocked
 Blocked --> Ready: 依赖与授权满足
 Ready --> Running: 原子领取有效尝试
 Running --> Verifying: 候选与产物已接纳
 Verifying --> Reviewing: 必要验证通过
 Verifying --> Rework: 行为失败
 Reviewing --> Rework: 审查缺陷
 Reviewing --> Verifying: 请求补证
 Reviewing --> Done: 合约通过
 Rework --> Ready: 新尝试或修订计划
 Running --> Blocked: 等待外部条件
 Ready --> Cancelled: 目标撤销或计划替换
 Running --> Cancelled: 停止并隔离尝试
 Done --> Rework: 下游发现原产物缺陷
